+ Wrap it in a Padding widget
- Set Text.padding
- Call text.addPadding()
- Use CSS
> Flutter composes behaviour by wrapping widgets.
? fill: Building UIs by nesting small widgets inside each other is called ___.
= composition
> Composition is the core idea of Flutter UI.
? mcq: Which of these is primarily a layout widget?
- Text
- Icon
+ Column
- Image
> Column arranges children vertically.
? scenario: A build method has grown to 300 lines. What is the recommended refactor?
