+ home
- start
- body
- firstRoute
> home is the default route widget.
? tf: Since Flutter 3.16, Material 3 is enabled by default.
= true
> useMaterial3 defaults to true.
? fill: To generate a full palette from one colour, use `ColorScheme.from___(seedColor: ...)`.
= Seed
> ColorScheme.fromSeed creates an accessible scheme from a seed colour.
